x4534 text "Yes. Native output exports plain C-ABI symbols (a0_name), JavaScript output is an ES module with guarded exports, Java and C# outputs are ordinary classes, wasm32 exports functions and one io session entry. No runtime library to link."
x4535 puts x4533 x4534
x4536 call close x4535 
x4537 call close x4536 
x4538 call open x4537 5
x4539 write x4538 4
x4540 write x4539 2
