x4546 puts x4544 x4545
x4547 call close x4546 
x4548 call open x4547 2
x4549 write x4548 2
x4550 text "There is none. A native binary of the ten benchmark kernels is about 33 KB including the driver; the wasm for this whole page is under half a megabyte with every string and style rule inside it."
x4551 puts x4549 x4550
x4552 call close x4551 
x4553 call close x4552 
x4554 call open x4553 5
x4555 write x4554 4
x4556 write x4555 2
x4557 text "card reveal"
x4558 puts x4556 x4557
x4559 call open x4558 15
x4560 write x4559 2
x4561 text "What happens when an AI makes a mistake?"
x4562 puts x4560 x4561
x4563 call close x4562 
x4564 call open x4563 2
x4565 write x4564 2
x4566 text "The edit is rejected before it lands, with a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision), what was expected, what was found, and the one action that fixes it. The program never changes."
x4567 puts x4565 x4566
x4568 call close x4567 
x4569 call close x4568 
x4570 call open x4569 5
x4571 write x4570 4
x4572 write x4571 2
x4573 text "card reveal"
x4574 puts x4572 x4573
x4575 call open x4574 15
x4576 write x4575 2
x4577 text "Can a wrong program burn compute?"
