x4579 call close x4578 
x4580 call open x4579 2
x4581 write x4580 2
x4582 text "No. Every function has a static iteration cap, the interpreter has fuel, io output is bounded, and there is no heap, recursion, or unbounded loop. A runaway is impossible by construction."
x4583 puts x4581 x4582
x4584 call close x4583 
x4585 call close x4584 
x4586 call open x4585 5
x4587 write x4586 4
x4588 write x4587 2
x4589 text "card reveal"
